{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/omadahealth/jobs/8084199","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3502418,"location":{"name":"Remote, USA"},"metadata":null,"id":8084199,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T17:09:17-04:00","requisition_id":"P101416","title":"Senior EPD Operations Manager","pay_input_ranges":[],"company_name":"Omada Health","first_published":"2026-07-31T17:09:17-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Omada Health is on a mission to bend the curve of chronic disease.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;The Senior EPD Operations Manager orchestrates Engineering, Product, and Design (EPD) teams to deliver major, complex initiatives in a cohesive, reliable way. Operating above individual workstreams, you align multiple teams around clear member and business value, and partner closely with Product Managers to translate strategic decisions into a coherent, executable launch plan with strong sequencing, risk visibility, and executive communication. While Product owns the roadmap, you make sure the organization executes against it; holding teams accountable, pushing for progress, and driving disciplined delivery against committed milestones.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;The Senior EPD Operations Manager brings strong technical program leadership to execution, combining a deep understanding of how Engineering, Product, and Design teams work, their dependencies, and their architecture, with awareness of member, customer, and business needs. Beyond supporting launch delivery, the Senior EPD Operations Manager brings general-manager–style breadth as a Sr. Manager-level individual contributor, owning planning, metrics, operations, and cross-functional coordination for your initiative. You operate credibly at the leadership level, convening Product, Design, and Engineering Directors and their PMs and EMs to align on sequencing, surface and mitigate risks, identify critical paths, and drive decisions, while holding your own in the room and keeping senior stakeholders aligned and accountable.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Your Impact:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Provide the operational rigor behind the integrated EPD launch plan for large, complex, highly technical initiatives spanning multiple teams and products.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Operate above individual workstreams, owning the discussion that brings Engineering, Product, and Design leaders together to align on milestones, dependencies, critical path, and deliverables. Stepping in to unblock when needed, but not managing day-to-day tasks or sprint execution.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Maintain a high-confidence view of status, risks, dependencies, and decisions across all workstreams, and drive resolution when plans drift or assumptions break.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Drive teams to plan ahead and execute against the roadmap, holding them accountable, surfacing slippage early, and pushing for progress so commitments are met.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Guide cross-functional leadership through difficult planning and resourcing trade-offs, escalating org-wide trade-offs when needed.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Refine and set up the rituals and cadences around metrics monitoring and team-level planning with Product Managers. Building lightweight, consistent processes (roadmap reviews, metrics rituals, readiness checkpoints) that drive accountability without becoming task management.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Build tools and processes that help EPD teams deliver against key business goals, and drive adoption of new standards within your programs.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Help teams define, instrument, and report against quantitative goals, OKRs, and metrics. Using qualitative and quantitative findings to set targets, track progress, and guide pivots.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Connecting execution signals to OKRs, member impact, and business outcomes so leadership sees both what’s on track and whether it’s moving the right numbers.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Serve as the key liaison across Engineering, Product, Design, Clinical, Care Delivery, Commercial, Compliance, Legal, Infosec, and Privacy, aligning stakeholders toward unified decisions.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Act as an EPD point of contact for triaging Commercial questions about the products in your scope.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Facilitate integrated planning, dependency and risk reviews, readiness checkpoints, go/no-go discussions, and retrospectives. Running program offsites where they serve your initiative.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Surface trade-offs, escalation paths, and recommendations to leadership, serving as the primary EPD narrator for delivery health with crisp, decision-ready updates.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Improve how launches run over time by refining operating rhythms, readiness criteria, templates, and retrospective learnings.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;About you:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;7+ years across product/technical program management, product management, general management, consulting, or product/business operations.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Excellent written and oral communication with executive presence. Able to flex altitude and technical depth across audiences, translating business impact and technical constraints into clear, decision-ready messaging for ICs, senior leaders, and executives alike.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Ability to see and help others see the big picture and drive toward it, operating above the team level yet diving into detail when needed.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Demonstrated experience in owning cross-team execution rigor on technically complex, multi-team initiatives.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Experience guiding teams to define goals, generate hypotheses, set metrics, execute, review, and pivot on early signals to deliver results.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Demonstrated experience defining and reporting against quantitative goals/OKRs/metrics, using qualitative and quantitative findings including for market analysis.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Strong understanding of how Engineering, Product, and Design organizations operate, including roadmap planning, dependencies, and release sequencing.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Enough technical depth to see the seams (systems, dependencies, architecture trade-offs)\u0026amp;nbsp; and to partner credibly with engineers and technical leads, without needing to be one.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Excellent organizational and analytical skills, thrives on attention to detail and process efficiency.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Strong relationship skills, with the ability to read team dynamics, plus high EQ across functions.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Bonus Points for:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Adopting AI tools in day to day work for productivity gains.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Enthusiasm for healthcare and technology.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;An MBA or related degree.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Benefits:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Competitive salary with generous annual cash bonus\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Equity grants\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Employee stock purchasing plan (ESPP)\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Remote first work from home culture\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Flexible Time Off to help you rest, recharge, and connect with loved ones\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Generous parental leave\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Health, dental, and vision insurance (and above market employer contributions)\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;401k retirement savings plan\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Lifestyle Spending Account (LSA)\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;Mental Health Support Solutions\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;...and more!\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;It takes a village to change health care. As we build together toward our mission, we strive to embody the following values in our day-to-day work. We hope these hold meaning for you as well as you consider Omada!\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Cultivate Trust.\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt; We listen closely and we operate with kindness. We provide respectful and candid feedback to each other.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Seek Context. \u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;We ask to understand and we build connections. We do our research up front to move faster down the road.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Act Boldly.\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt; We innovate daily to solve problems, improve processes, and find new opportunities for our members and customers.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Deliver Results. \u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;We reward impact above output. We set a high bar, we’re not afraid to fail, and we take pride in our work.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Succeed Together. \u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;We prioritize Omada’s progress above team or individual. We have fun as we get stuff done, and we celebrate together.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;li\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;Remember Why We’re Here.\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt; We push through the challenges of changing health care because we know the destination is worth it.\u0026lt;/li\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;/ul\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;About Omada Health:\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt; Omada Health (Nasdaq: OMDA) is reverse engineering the way healthcare is delivered in America, putting the space between doctor visits–where health is won or lost–at the center of care. Today\u0026#39;s healthcare system poorly serves chronic conditions that require ongoing support outside of the exam room, like obesity, diabetes, hypertension, cholesterol, and musculoskeletal conditions. Omada’s virtual-first model combines human-led care teams, connected devices, and AI-enabled technology to deliver personalized care at scale, including support for GLP-1 therapy. Omada has served more than two million members since launch across 2,000+ employers, health plans, pharmacy benefit managers, and health systems. Learn more at omadahealth.com.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Omada is thrilled to share that we’ve been certified as a Great Place to Work! Please\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.com/certified-company/7022924\u0026quot;\u0026gt;click here\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt; for more information.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;We carefully hire the best talent we can find, which means actively seeking diversity of beliefs, backgrounds, education, and ways of thinking. We strive to build an inclusive culture where differences are celebrated and leveraged to inform better design and business decisions. Omada is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and affirmative action employer. We are committed to equal opportunity regardless of race, color, religion, sex, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, physical or mental disability, legally protected medical condition, family care status, military or veteran status, marital status, domestic partner status, sexual orientation, or any other basis protected by local, state, or federal laws. Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Below is a summary of salary ranges, by geographic zone, for this role*. These ranges represent a good faith estimate of the minimum and maximum base salary for the position in that zone at the time of posting. Please refer to this\u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/14E-cuIgPhwmVeVg3UdhzqhOYqeu-pTEU/view?usp=sharing\u0026quot;\u0026gt; \u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;\u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;https://www.omadahealth.com/hubfs/Hiring%20Documents/Omada_Salary_Zones.pdf\u0026quot;\u0026gt;resource\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt; for detail on zone designations.\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Zone 1: $174,800 - $218,500\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Zone 2: $167,200 - $209,000\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Zone 3: $152,000 - $192,000\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Please note that zones may be updated as market data changes but we will honor the range applicable to your zone (which is determined by your location) as of your application date.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;*The actual offer, including the compensation package, will be within the posted range for the relevant zone and will be determined based on multiple factors, such as the candidate\u0026#39;s skills and experience, and other business considerations such as internal equity.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\n\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;Please\u0026amp;nbsp;\u0026lt;a href=\u0026quot;https://www.omadahealth.com/applicant-specific-notice\u0026quot;\u0026gt;click here \u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;for more information on our Candidate Privacy Notice.\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;","departments":[{"id":68190,"name":"Product Management","child_ids":[],"parent_id":10249}],"offices":[{"id":6388,"name":"Remote","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null,"compliance":null,"demographic_questions":{"header":"Voluntary Self Identification","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eAt Omada, we\u0026rsquo;re working every day to build a team where people from all backgrounds can thrive. To help us learn more about how we can increase diversity in our candidate pool, we invite you to provide demographic information in a confidential survey. Your responses will \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003enot\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e be associated with your specific application and will not in any way be used in the hiring decision.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","questions":[{"id":1736,"label":"I identify my gender as:","required":false,"type":"multi_value_multi_select","answer_options":[{"id":12223,"label":"Female","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12224,"label":"Male","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12225,"label":"Non-binary / third gender (Inclusive of bigender, agender, androgynous, gender fluid, gender non-conforming)","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12226,"label":"I prefer to self-describe","free_form":true,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12227,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false}]},{"id":1737,"label":"I identify as transgender:","required":false,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":12228,"label":"Yes","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12229,"label":"No","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12230,"label":"I prefer to self-describe","free_form":true,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12231,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false}]},{"id":1738,"label":"I identify my sexual orientation as:","required":false,"type":"multi_value_multi_select","answer_options":[{"id":12232,"label":"Asexual","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12233,"label":"Bisexual, pansexual and/or queer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12234,"label":"Gay and/or lesbian","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12235,"label":"Heterosexual","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12236,"label":"I prefer to self-describe","free_form":true,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12237,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false}]},{"id":1739,"label":"Which of the following best represents your racial or ethnic background: (Check more than one if that is how you identify) ","required":false,"type":"multi_value_multi_select","answer_options":[{"id":12238,"label":"Alaskan Native / American Indian / Indigenous American / Native American","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12239,"label":"Black / Of African descent","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12240,"label":"East Asian","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12241,"label":"Hispanic","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12242,"label":"Latina/o/x","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12243,"label":"Middle Eastern","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12244,"label":"Native Hawaiian","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12245,"label":"Pacific Islander","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12246,"label":"South Asian","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12247,"label":"White","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12248,"label":"Multiracial/Mixed Race","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12249,"label":"I prefer to self-describe","free_form":true,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12250,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false}]},{"id":1740,"label":"Veteran Status:","required":false,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":12251,"label":"Yes, I am a veteran","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12252,"label":"No, I am not a veteran","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12253,"label":"I prefer to self-describe","free_form":true,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12254,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false}]},{"id":1741,"label":"Do you identify as a person with a disability of any kind, visible or invisible?","required":false,"type":"multi_value_single_select","answer_options":[{"id":12255,"label":"Yes","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12256,"label":"No","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12257,"label":"I prefer to self-describe","free_form":true,"decline_to_answer":false},{"id":12258,"label":"I don't wish to answer","free_form":false,"decline_to_answer":false}]}]},"questions":[{"description":null,"label":"First Name","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"first_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Last Name","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"last_name","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Email","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"email","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Phone","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"phone","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Resume/CV","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"resume","type":"input_file","values":[]},{"name":"resume_text","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Cover Letter","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"cover_letter","type":"input_file","values":[]},{"name":"cover_letter_text","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"LinkedIn Profile","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"question_68237078","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Website","required":false,"fields":[{"name":"question_68237079","type":"input_text","values":[]}]},{"description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWe are unable to employ candidates residing outside of the US.\u003c/strong\u003e Due to the nature of our work, data, specifically personal health information may not be accessed, disclosed or used outside of the U.S. Please note that the U.S. is limited to the 50 states of the United States.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","label":"Do you currently live in the United States? ","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_68237080","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Yes","value":1},{"label":"No","value":0}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"How many years of experience do you have leading complex initiatives at the program level — coordinating across multiple Engineering, Product, and Design teams (not solely as a single-team PM, EM, or designer)?\n","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_68363807","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Less than 4 years","value":738902295},{"label":"4–6 years","value":738902296},{"label":"7–10 years","value":738902297},{"label":"10+ years","value":738902298}]}]},{"description":"\u003cp\u003eYour selection reflects the highest level of leadership that you have \u003cstrong\u003eregularly\u003c/strong\u003e presented status and risk to via weekly reports, meetings, or demonstrations.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","label":"Given these options, please indicate the highest level of leadership that you have regularly presented delivery status or risk to. \n","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_68363808","type":"multi_value_single_select","values":[{"label":"Managers","value":738902299},{"label":"Directors","value":738902300},{"label":"VPs","value":738902301},{"label":"C-Suite","value":738902302}]}]},{"description":null,"label":"In 1-2 sentences, how do you decide what makes it into an executive update versus what stays at the team level?","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_68363809","type":"textarea","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"A cross-functional program has an unclear delivery date and unresolved dependencies across multiple teams. Commercial is asking for a firm commitment. Describe how you'd drive the teams to a credible answer, and how you'd represent the uncertainty to stakeholders without either overcommitting or stalling them. \n","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"question_68363810","type":"textarea","values":[]}]}],"location_questions":[{"description":null,"label":"Longitude","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"longitude","type":"input_hidden","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Latitude","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"latitude","type":"input_hidden","values":[]}]},{"description":null,"label":"Location","required":true,"fields":[{"name":"location","type":"input_text","values":[]}]}]}